title: "NeoRec: A Production-Style Multi-Stage Recommender System"
abstract: >
  An end-to-end, reproducible, industrial-style recommendation pipeline on
  MovieLens with multi-channel recall, DeepFM pre-ranking, DIN fine-ranking,
  MMR re-ranking, and a containerized FastAPI + Streamlit deployment.
